              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sunny"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was skeptical about the recipe because the raw chicken was sitting in a goopy mess overnight. But it fried up beautifully with a great exterior. I made the recipe exactly but it needed a little bit more sweetness. I would try a reader's suggestion of adding honey next time.",
