            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Keith Viall"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely awesome chicken, lived in Hawaii(Kauai) for a year, sold a some local restaurants, live in Guam now not sold, had to duplicate. You can play with this recipe. Add minced peppers for hot(sweet) wings, more pressed garlic, minced nuts(your favorite works well), sesame seeds, tastes best with peanut oil. Oil temp is best at 375. Goodluck!",
            "datePublished": "2014-06-28T21:38:53.913Z"
          },
