              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Heidi'sHunny"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am a huge wing fan and I've got to say these rank right up at the top. I did not have the redclay sea salt but did have some smoked sea salt and used that. This is definately in my recipe box for good.",
            "datePublished": "2010-06-06T08:26:33.377Z"
