            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LADYHEN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Although this recipe gave the chicken a nice little asian taste and a beautiful crispy crust, it seemed like it was missing something. I wish the recipe included a teriyaki sauce or something to dip in. Next time, I may try cut up pieces of chicken breast and make my own teriyaki dipping sauce.\n\nThanks for sharing the recipe! I love the way the corn starch and mochiko make such a lovely crust!",
            "datePublished": "2007-06-12T21:05:40.947Z"
          },
          {
