            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JasminaMama"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Although I didn't merinade the chicken for as long as I should have, the chicken came out wonderfully! The color was so nice and the outside crispy. For me, 10 minutes made them perfect! I do recommend this recipe!",
